# No Cursor git attribution

Never add Cursor (or any AI tool) as a git contributor, co-author, or commit/PR trailer.

## Forbidden

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`
- `Co-authored-by: Cursor Agent …`
- `Made-with: Cursor`
- Any similar `Co-authored-by` / `Made-with` line naming Cursor or an AI agent
- `--trailer` (or equivalent) that injects the above when running `git commit`, `gh pr create`, or related commands

## Required

- Commit and PR messages must credit only the human author from local git config
- If tooling or a template inserts a Cursor attribution trailer, remove it before finishing the commit or PR
- Do not amend history solely to add attribution; stripping forbidden trailers when the user asks is allowed

```text
# ❌ BAD
Release 0.2.5: Forza Horizon 6 FFB (WIP).

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

# ✅ GOOD
Release 0.2.5: Forza Horizon 6 FFB (WIP).
```
